    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and tangible solutions—like solving puzzles that reveal hidden patterns. I love how it’s both precise and creative, especially when tackling problems in philosophy or physics. It’s empowering to see how logic can explain the world, even if some equations feel intimidating at first.",
